Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 11:15:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 116/154] fix(settings): list spaces in sidebar order in the
 Spaces and Routing panes
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The settings window pushed spaces.json's raw array order, so the Spaces
pane list and the Routing pane's targetSpaceID select drew array order
instead of sidebar order. SpacesInSidebarOrder sorts the pushed document
by the order field before OnSpacesLoaded forwards it.

Signed-off-by: János Mikó <693558+janosmiko@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 chrome/browser/ui/BUILD.gn | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/chrome/browser/ui/BUILD.gn b/chrome/browser/ui/BUILD.gn
index 41a5ec30bb65c..64a4d1fe1d2b5 100644
--- a/chrome/browser/ui/BUILD.gn
+++ b/chrome/browser/ui/BUILD.gn
@@ -664,6 +664,7 @@ static_library("ui") {
     "//chrome/browser/ui/atrium:sidebar_seam_line",
     "//chrome/browser/ui/atrium:sidebar_snapshot_gate",
     "//chrome/browser/ui/atrium:slot_presentation_table",
+    "//chrome/browser/ui/atrium:spaces_order",
     "//chrome/browser/ui/atrium:split_orientation_decision",
     "//chrome/browser/ui/atrium:split_tree",
     "//chrome/browser/ui/atrium:split_tree_layout",
